02:0003A416 0003A426        	  5266:     dc.l    Moldorm_Chase   ; jump table entry (32-bit for _m68k_tablejump)
02:0003A41A 0003A426        	  5267:     dc.l    Moldorm_Chase   ; jump table entry (32-bit for _m68k_tablejump)
02:0003A41E 0003A426        	  5268:     dc.l    Moldorm_Chase   ; jump table entry (32-bit for _m68k_tablejump)
